Z||000004||wwh0001||01-06-2000||04:28 PM||||The stalk you are referring to is not the wiper (or turnsignal) switch. Those switches are in the steering column. If the stalk is broke it is an easy fix,push/twist its out.  And no wiring if no cruise control. However if your wipers are not working properly, more than likely it is not because of a bad stalk. ||||reg||1
